## Caveats / known risks

```text
Finding:
  This branch touches worker disposal helper boundaries after the model-disposal-policy bugfix.
Affected surface:
  llama_worker/llama.mjs disposal flow and session/context disposal helpers.
Why it matters:
  reset_model must remain conservative while terminal shutdown keeps the bounded model.dispose policy from the bugfix branch.
Smallest safe correction:
  Preserve operation-aware disposeModelStack call sites and keep model disposal policy outside this branch's new helpers.
What still needs verification:
  Michael-side real-runtime cancellation/shutdown gates after applying the rebased branch.
```

